# Real secrets live only in .env, which must never be committed. Unlike the
# n8n encryption key in docker-compose.yml (a local dev-only fallback), the
# variables in this project's .env are live third-party credentials tied to
# the user's real accounts (Telegram bot token, tunnel URL, n8n owner login).
# They must never enter git history, even as a "placeholder that gets swapped
# later".
.env
